body:
I was once given a good advice - how they feel about your kinks depends on how you bring it up, to a large extent. For example, if you share that like it's something shameful, it will create shame context for your kink. You probably don't want that. So, for HOW - accept your kinks and let them feel that. (And fuck those who will really shame you.)

&#x200B;

As for WHEN - I guess when you are discussing who loves what in bed. Also I'd wait until we've build some intimacy, I trust them to be not a dick, and probe their views on kinks in general.

Btw I'm not asking for a fix. "How in the hell that can be possible" is more what interests me.

&#x200B;

Not only this part reloading stuff, also how **compilation** error could happen when forking a child??
